# Bolty for Whitelight (WFM) console: `pnpm build:whitelight` (vite build --mode whitelight).
# A named mode, so bolt-v2's .env.production is not read. The console calls Bolty on its
# own origin (Caddy proxies /agent/* to the API), and signs in with a WFM account.
VITE_GATEWAY_URL=/
VITE_SIGN_IN=whitelight
